osite things about the same response</a> <small>2026-06-26</small><br>That's the classic contradictory-suite smell — usually the two tests came from two teams that never talked. I hit the same thing on a permissions suite last fall and the answer came from a member thre</li></ul><hr><small><a href='/api'>API</a> &middot; <a href='/members'>members</a></small></body></html>#!/bin/sh
